541
00:38:29,634 --> 00:38:30,611
Jihoon’s here.

542
00:38:31,914 --> 00:38:32,816
Guys.

543
00:38:32,817 --> 00:38:34,516
Guys, come save me!

544
00:38:35,275 --> 00:38:36,631
Who can you save?

545
00:38:36,632 --> 00:38:37,436
Save Junkyu. Save Junkyu.

546
00:38:37,437 --> 00:38:38,737
- I’ll save Junkyu.
- Yeah, save Junkyu.

547
00:38:38,969 --> 00:38:40,162
Jihoon!

548
00:38:40,940 --> 00:38:41,707
Thank you.

549
00:38:46,380 --> 00:38:47,620
[Phone dings]

550
00:38:47,621 --> 00:38:50,959
Hey, it says a dark shadow is about to fall on someone.

551
00:38:50,960 --> 00:38:52,395
What does that mean? What does it mean?

552
00:38:53,319 --> 00:38:55,848
[With only 444 seconds left, a dark shadow will fall upon you]

553
00:38:58,672 --> 00:39:00,941
[Open the jail on the 1st floor]

554
00:39:02,241 --> 00:39:05,180
[Dark shadows head out in search of their victims]

555
00:39:05,549 --> 00:39:07,413
[The shadows will stay till the game is over]

556
00:39:07,767 --> 00:39:08,667
Run!

557
00:39:09,286 --> 00:39:10,348
Run, run!

558
00:39:10,655 --> 00:39:11,740
I’ll be right back, Jaehyuk.

559
00:39:11,741 --> 00:39:13,433
What’s happening? Why are you coming out? What's going on?

560
00:39:14,438 --> 00:39:15,923
Why are you coming out? Why?

561
00:39:17,275 --> 00:39:18,356
Guys, someone just came out downstairs!

562
00:39:18,308 --> 00:39:19,096
Downstairs!

563
00:39:21,427 --> 00:39:22,269
What the heck?

564
00:39:22,736 --> 00:39:23,538
What is that?

565
00:39:26,547 --> 00:39:27,999
[Asahi's shadow]
What is that?

566
00:39:28,496 --> 00:39:29,260
Wait a second.

567
00:39:30,044 --> 00:39:32,203
Darkness stuck to me.

568
00:39:32,204 --> 00:39:35,297
Oh? It got on me too. Sorry.

569
00:39:41,130 --> 00:39:42,669
Doesn’t this feel like Gonjiam?

570
00:39:44,981 --> 00:39:48,311
[Taking refuge on the 2nd floor]

571
00:39:50,041 --> 00:39:50,957
Who is that?

572
00:39:53,687 --> 00:39:56,136
[Doyoung's shadow]

573
00:40:00,026 --> 00:40:01,172
Aha!

574
00:40:02,076 --> 00:40:03,654
After 444 seconds...

575
00:40:04,798 --> 00:40:05,864
We got that text, remember?

576
00:40:06,615 --> 00:40:08,101
It said a shadow would cling to us.

577
00:40:08,102 --> 00:40:09,059
A shadow

578
00:40:10,010 --> 00:40:11,289
latched onto us.

579
00:40:12,759 --> 00:40:13,677
Creepy.

580
00:40:14,589 --> 00:40:16,411
It’s literally a shadow.

581
00:40:16,412 --> 00:40:18,774
So it’s stuck behind us?

582
00:40:19,371 --> 00:40:20,565
Put it in front of you.

583
00:40:20,843 --> 00:40:22,172
How do I stick it in front?

584
00:40:23,208 --> 00:40:25,494
So if these guys get caught

585
00:40:25,495 --> 00:40:26,703
does it mean we got caught too?

586
00:40:26,704 --> 00:40:27,598
Because they're our shadows?

587
00:40:28,199 --> 00:40:29,029
Possibly?

588
00:40:30,658 --> 00:40:31,976
Dude, your shadow arrived.

589
00:40:37,702 --> 00:40:40,902
[Half shadow, half person]

590
00:40:41,071 --> 00:40:42,187
This is driving me crazy.

591
00:40:43,871 --> 00:40:47,385
[Time left]

592
00:41:02,477 --> 00:41:04,094
They say there’s a key in the second maze on the third floor.

593
00:41:04,095 --> 00:41:05,041
We haven’t gone there?

594
00:41:05,042 --> 00:41:05,992
No, no one has.

595
00:41:05,993 --> 00:41:07,241
I’ll head up to the third floor.

596
00:41:07,802 --> 00:41:09,318
Ah! You scared me!

597
00:41:09,641 --> 00:41:10,314
Dude!

598
00:41:10,315 --> 00:41:11,453
You freaked the shadow out.

599
00:41:27,051 --> 00:41:28,196
Should we go to the third floor?

600
00:41:28,197 --> 00:41:29,267
Can I be honest?

601
00:41:29,268 --> 00:41:29,648
Yeah.

602
00:41:29,649 --> 00:41:31,133
I really don’t want to go.

603
00:41:32,327 --> 00:41:34,376
We can just find the key and go.

604
00:41:49,496 --> 00:41:50,308
Hyunsuk!

605
00:41:51,258 --> 00:41:52,566
I’m going to save Jaehyuk.

606
00:41:53,930 --> 00:41:54,972
How’d you do that?

607
00:41:54,973 --> 00:41:56,533
I found the third-floor key.

608
00:41:56,534 --> 00:41:57,353
How’d you find it?

609
00:41:57,354 --> 00:41:59,218
No idea. Just found it.

610
00:41:59,219 --> 00:42:01,009
Using the clue?

611
00:42:01,010 --> 00:42:03,148
I just ended up in the right room, I guess.

612
00:42:03,149 --> 00:42:04,405
I wasn’t even praying or anything.

613
00:42:04,406 --> 00:42:06,383
Let’s hide. All we have to do is hide now.

614
00:42:06,687 --> 00:42:07,457
Let’s just hide.

615
00:42:07,458 --> 00:42:08,786
But who were those people in black earlier?

616
00:42:08,787 --> 00:42:09,969
I have no idea.

617
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:27,273
Is it over?

618
00:42:27,863 --> 00:42:31,246
- I can’t find them, uh oh.
- It’s over.

619
00:42:31,247 --> 00:42:32,002
It’s over.

620
00:42:32,323 --> 00:42:36,003
I can’t find them, uh oh.

621
00:42:36,665 --> 00:42:40,135
I can’t find them, uh oh.

622
00:43:03,038 --> 00:43:04,327
But this place was totally legendary.

623
00:43:05,259 --> 00:43:06,587
At first, we were all suspicious of each other.

624
00:43:06,588 --> 00:43:07,191
Right, right.

625
00:43:07,192 --> 00:43:08,792
We even suspected Junkyu at first.

626
00:43:09,639 --> 00:43:11,900
The entire game started because of him.

627
00:43:13,199 --> 00:43:13,958
Seriously.

628
00:43:15,529 --> 00:43:17,212
The moment he opened that box, the game started.

629
00:43:17,213 --> 00:43:20,082
Doyoung basically kicked things off.

630
00:43:20,497 --> 00:43:22,862
Yeah, I was the one who opened that box.

631
00:43:22,863 --> 00:43:25,089
There was a ghost in there.

632
00:43:25,955 --> 00:43:26,731
Like this.

633
00:43:27,347 --> 00:43:28,040
Really?

634
00:43:28,041 --> 00:43:29,858
And that’s how the game began.

635
00:43:29,859 --> 00:43:30,701
Really?

636
00:43:30,702 --> 00:43:31,520
Exactly.

637
00:43:32,194 --> 00:43:33,585
I want to see the seeker at least once.

638
00:43:34,188 --> 00:43:35,272
I never got to see them.

639
00:43:35,273 --> 00:43:35,612
Seriously?

640
00:43:35,613 --> 00:43:36,411
Not even once.

641
00:43:37,941 --> 00:43:39,403
Let me read this, guys.

642
00:43:39,404 --> 00:43:41,841
Hide and seek is over.

643
00:43:41,842 --> 00:43:44,270
Check the target survival rate on your keys.

644
00:43:44,271 --> 00:43:48,344
If TREASURE’s survival rate is above the target

645
00:43:48,345 --> 00:43:51,039
there will be a big reward for Treasure Maker.

646
00:43:51,040 --> 00:43:53,243
It feels like we can win any prize now, since it’s 100%.

647
00:43:53,418 --> 00:43:54,259
We’re at 100%?

648
00:43:54,260 --> 00:43:54,872
Everyone survived?

649
00:43:55,608 --> 00:43:58,636
At the last minute, I saved Jaehyuk and we hit 100%.

650
00:43:58,614 --> 00:43:59,444
We saved everyone.

651
00:44:00,046 --> 00:44:01,880
I was so touched by Hyunsuk earlier.

652
00:44:01,881 --> 00:44:04,046
He totally carried us, right?

653
00:44:04,047 --> 00:44:04,814
Yeah, you really

654
00:44:04,815 --> 00:44:05,505
carried us.

655
00:44:05,506 --> 00:44:06,479
For real.

656
00:44:06,866 --> 00:44:08,492
Since we hit 100%, that means

657
00:44:08,493 --> 00:44:10,138
we can give a special gift back to Treasure Maker.

658
00:44:11,135 --> 00:44:14,249
We’re at 100%! We’re at 100%!

659
00:44:14,250 --> 00:44:15,271
One, two, three!

660
00:44:16,713 --> 00:44:17,625
That was terrifying.

661
00:44:17,986 --> 00:44:19,258
That was insane.
